      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 7.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "hmm, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.73,
      "end_seconds": 14.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "you're alright take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.49,
      "end_seconds": 18.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I'm here because of no symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 19.55,
      "end_seconds": 32.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.24,
      "text": "Doctor I've got the readings for you. BP is 115 over 76 oxygen saturation is 99 percent respiratory rate 16. Pulse is 80 beats a minute temp 37.0 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.51,
      "end_seconds": 39.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "okay, noted so, how long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.42,
      "end_seconds": 56.91,
      "duration_seconds": 16.49,
      "text": "It's been like this since last night. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.21,
      "end_seconds": 60.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Sure. Rate it for me mild moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.18,
      "end_seconds": 73.73,
      "duration_seconds": 11.55,
      "text": "A four out of ten, I suppose. I've, I've also had slightly tired. And a low blood count on a routine test, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.18,
      "end_seconds": 81.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any blood in the stool or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.96,
      "end_seconds": 85.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.63,
      "end_seconds": 92.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Let me check a few things. Any black stools or heavy periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.08,
      "end_seconds": 96.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "no, I'd have said so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.05,
      "end_seconds": 101.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.62,
      "end_seconds": 104.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "no rashes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.42,
      "end_seconds": 126.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.73,
      "end_seconds": 132.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat for about ten years now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.07,
      "end_seconds": 145.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "text": "Okay, I can see an irregular heartbeat in your file as well. Have you got any known allergies? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.16,
      "end_seconds": 149.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "no, not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.97,
      "end_seconds": 151.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.17,
      "end_seconds": 156.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.74,
      "end_seconds": 161.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Right, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.02,
      "end_seconds": 166.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.31,
      "end_seconds": 169.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.06,
      "end_seconds": 175.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.81,
      "end_seconds": 178.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Do you work outside the the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.4,
      "end_seconds": 184.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.95,
      "end_seconds": 189.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.49,
      "end_seconds": 192.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.34,
      "end_seconds": 203.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.03,
      "end_seconds": 216.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.78,
      "text": "I take metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day. Ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, most days. I was on warfarin before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.76,
      "end_seconds": 221.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Okay time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.51,
      "end_seconds": 224.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "So breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.99,
      "end_seconds": 237.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Your pulse and blood pressure are normal, and the eyelids are pale."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.92,
      "end_seconds": 244.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.41,
      "end_seconds": 271.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is iron-deficiency anaemia needing a source found a bowel cancer is still possible"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.41,
      "end_seconds": 275.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.12,
      "end_seconds": 296.93,
      "duration_seconds": 19.81,
      "text": "It's reasonable to to be concerned but right now iron-deficiency anaemia needing a source found is my leading thought not anything worse. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had no symptoms since last night and no weight loss or blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.76,
      "end_seconds": 298.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.14,
      "end_seconds": 334.16,
      "duration_seconds": 34.02,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a coeliac blood test cos of anaemia. I want an iron study done, that's for anaemia. I'd like you to take ferrous sulfate, 200 milligrams, once a day, three months. You take it by mouth. It's for iron deficiency. Stop the ibuprofen and we will refer you for scopes. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. I'm gonna send a referral to the lower GI team"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.88,
      "end_seconds": 338.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.16,
      "end_seconds": 355.7,
      "duration_seconds": 14.54,
      "text": "come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse let's plan a check after the tests is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.55,
      "end_seconds": 361.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "okay that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.82,
      "end_seconds": 363.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
